## 2.5.5 (Released 2026-03-22) {#2.5.5}

### Lead Moderator support {#2.5.5-lead-moderator}

<div class="changelog-entry">

This release improves support for the Lead Moderator role.

Unfortunately, many of the features of the Lead Moderator can only be performed through the Twitch website and not through third party applications like Chatterino.

{{ credit(author="Juliapixel, jupjohn", helper="pajlada", prs="6642, 6665") }}

</div>

### Slow Mode counter {#2.5.5-slow-mode-counter}

<div class="changelog-entry">

Added a countdown timer to the input box to show when you can chat again during slow mode or after you've been timed out.  
This feature is disabled by default, and can be enabled with the "Show countdown on slow mode or when timed out" setting.

{{ figure("/img/changelog/2.5.5/countdown.png") }}

{{ credit(author="achow101", helper="Nerixyz, pajlada", prs="6782, 6791") }}

</div>

