### Watch streak {#2.5.5-watch-streak}

Watch streaks are now seperated from subscriptions in highlights and filters.

<br />

#### Example filters:

- Hide watch streak notifications, including the message the user sent: `!flags.watch_streak`
- Hide watch streak notifications, but show the message the user sent: `!(flags.watch_streak && message.content contains "consecutive streams this month and sparked a watch streak")`

{{ figure("/img/changelog/2.5.5/watch-streak-filter.png", caption="Showing off the two example filters in action") }}

{{ credit(author="devPoland, pajlada", prs="6571, 6581, 6841") }}

### Miscellaneous features {#2.5.5-miscellaneous-features}

<div class="changelog-entry">

- You can now control the character limit of deleted messages with the "Limit length of deleted messages" setting. {{ credit(author="jacob-thompson", prs="6491", inline=true) }}

- You can now right-click any tab and sort your tabs by name alphabetically. This is an action, not a setting meaning if you want to sort your tabs again, you have to click the sort action again. {{ credit(author="teknsl, ruinivist", helper="Nerixyz, pajlada", prs="6551, 6710", inline=true) }}

- You can now close multiple tabs at the same time (e.g. close other tabs, or close tabs to the right) {{ credit(author="otaviobia", helper="jupjohn", prs="6515, 6619", inline=true) }}

- You can now customize the /live messages to include the stream title. {{ credit(author="Julia-Roman", prs="6572", inline=true) }}

- You can now pre-define the title & duration of a clip (Usage: `/clip --duration 10 the title`). {{ credit(author="iProdigy", prs="6669", inline=true) }}

- You can now create a filter based on the author's external badges. (e.g.
  `author.external_badges contains "chatterino:Top Donator"` or
  `author.external_badges contains "frankerfacez:bot"`) {{ credit(author="achow101, pajlada", prs="6709", inline=true) }}

- You can now use Markdown in user notes. {{ credit(author="jacob-thompson", helper="pajlada, Nerixyz", prs="6490, 6676", inline=true) }}

- You can now reset the channel in the `/watching` chat. {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="6759", inline=true) }}

- Follower-mode duration now displays as hours or days if possible. {{ credit(author="Nerixyz", prs="6812", inline=true) }}

